## Historical item disposition

Transport maps, bounce handling, content filtering, hold queues, reputation input,
rate limiting, monitoring, audit logging and recovery documentation were formerly
unchecked despite implementation. Deployment setup remains above. Bayesian spam
filtering is a scanner/model integration decision, not evidence of a built-in
trained classifier. Retention/compaction exists, but comprehensive automated DLQ
and backup disposal remains operational/engineering work. Encryption at rest is
a deployment requirement; no built-in encrypted journal is claimed. Extension
work remains scoped separately. Measured performance improvements and privacy
workflow coverage are recorded above; production validation remains open.
